# ==============================
# Full-resolution photo originals (~700 MB)
# Source files for `npm run images`; the web-ready crops in
# public/images/opt/ are what the site ships and stay tracked.
# Keep the originals in shared storage (or Git LFS) instead.
# The official logo is small and is the source of every brand asset, so it stays tracked.
# ==============================
images/images/*
!images/images/logo/

.env.example/
vite.config.ts/